{
  "uid": "cota-the-odds-api",
  "title": "Cota da The Odds API",
  "description": "Consumo, saldo e estado do guardrail da The Odds API (issue #58). Metricas expostas por GET /actuator/prometheus. Os limiares dos paineis espelham odds.api.min-requests-remaining (50) e o dobro dele (100), que sao os mesmos limiares dos avisos em log.",
  "tags": ["cartola-odds", "the-odds-api", "cota"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-30d", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": { "text": "Prometheus", "value": "prometheus-cartola" },
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "minimo",
        "label": "Minimo do guardrail",
        "description": "Espelha odds.api.min-requests-remaining (ODDS_API_MIN_REQUESTS_REMAINING). O minimo nao e exportado como metrica; o painel de guardrail precisa dele para saber onde esta o corte.",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "50",
        "current": { "text": "50", "value": "50" },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "cota_mensal",
        "label": "Cota do plano",
        "description": "Requisicoes por mes do plano contratado (free = 500). Usado so para derivar o consumo: remaining + used = cota do plano, e used nao e exportado como metrica.",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "500",
        "current": { "text": "500", "value": "500" },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Saldo restante",
      "description": "Ultimo valor lido do header x-requests-remaining. Enquanto nao houve leitura nenhuma a metrica vale NaN — e nao zero —, e o painel mostra 'sem leitura ainda'. Saldo baixo e saldo nao lido sao estados diferentes e pedem reacoes diferentes.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "odds_api_requests_remaining",
          "legendFormat": "saldo",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "sem leitura ainda",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 50 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 100 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Consumo no mes",
      "description": "Derivado de $cota_mensal - saldo restante: remaining + used somam a cota do plano, e o consumo (x-requests-used) nao e exportado como metrica. Zera na virada do mes, quando o provedor renova a cota. Os limiares de cor (400 e 450) sao 80% e 90% do plano free de 500 — ajuste junto com a variavel se o plano mudar.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "$cota_mensal - odds_api_requests_remaining",
          "legendFormat": "consumo",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "sem leitura ainda",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 400 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 450 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Taxa de erro (janela do dashboard)",
      "description": "errors/requests na janela selecionada. E uma taxa legitima porque os dois contadores medem tentativas: o OddsClient conta a chamada antes de faze-la, entao errors e sempre subconjunto de requests. Sem nenhuma chamada na janela a divisao nao produz valor e o painel mostra 'sem chamadas'.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "increase(odds_api_errors_total[$__range]) / increase(odds_api_requests_total[$__range])",
          "legendFormat": "taxa de erro",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "noValue": "sem chamadas",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.2 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Guardrail",
      "description": "clamp(sgn($minimo - saldo), 0, 1): 1 quando o saldo esta abaixo do minimo (guardrail armado, a aplicacao parou de chamar o provedor), 0 quando esta acima, e NaN quando ainda nao houve leitura — a aritmetica preserva o NaN de proposito, para 'sem leitura' nao virar 'desarmado'.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "clamp(sgn($minimo - odds_api_requests_remaining), 0, 1)",
          "legendFormat": "guardrail",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "noValue": "sem leitura ainda",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "text": "desarmado", "color": "green", "index": 0 },
                "1": { "text": "ARMADO", "color": "red", "index": 1 }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Saldo restante ao longo do mes",
      "description": "A linha tracejada marca o minimo do guardrail. Trechos sem linha sao periodos sem leitura (NaN) ou sem a aplicacao no ar — nao sao saldo zero.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "odds_api_requests_remaining",
          "legendFormat": "saldo restante"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": [] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "none" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" }
          },
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "transparent", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 50 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Chamadas e erros por hora",
      "description": "Tentativas de chamada a The Odds API, contadas antes da requisicao: uma chamada que falha consumiu credito igual e aparece nas duas series.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "increase(odds_api_requests_total[1h])",
          "legendFormat": "chamadas"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "increase(odds_api_errors_total[1h])",
          "legendFormat": "erros"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": [] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "none" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "erros" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Taxa de erro (janela de 6 h)",
      "description": "Mesma janela da regra CotaOddsApiTaxaDeErroAlta. A janela e de horas, e nao de minutos, porque o cache de odds vale 60 min: um rate() curto seria zero quase sempre.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "increase(odds_api_errors_total[6h]) / increase(odds_api_requests_total[6h])",
          "legendFormat": "erros / chamadas"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": [] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "none" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" }
          },
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "transparent", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
